    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "China has made new rules for fireworks to make them safer. The rules started on May 1. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "government",
            "zh": "政府"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "decision",
            "ref": "v-decision"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " after some "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "accidents",
            "ref": "v-accident"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the past few years."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before, different factories followed different rules. That was "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "confusing",
            "zh": "令人困惑的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Now, all rules are put together into one simple "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "system",
            "zh": "体系"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This makes it easier to check if fireworks are safe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fireworks are also grouped in new ways. Some are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "designed",
            "ref": "v-design"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for cities, for example, in streets and public "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "squares",
            "zh": "广场"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". These "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "types",
            "ref": "v-type"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are made to be safer in busy places."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Noise rules are also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stricter",
            "ref": "v-strict"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In the past, fireworks could be very loud, even like a plane sound. Now, the rules "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "set limits on",
            "zh": "对……设限"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " how loud fireworks can be. This helps make cities quieter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Dangerous",
            "ref": "v-dangerous"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "materials",
            "zh": "材料"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are no longer allowed. Also, all fireworks must show clear "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "labels",
            "zh": "标签"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the box. The label must include the name, safety level and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "warnings",
            "ref": "v-warning"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "However, even with these new rules, a serious accident still happened. On May 4, an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "explosion",
            "zh": "爆炸"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "took place",
            "ref": "v-take-place"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at a fireworks factory in Liuyang, Hunan Province. Many people were killed and more were hurt. This "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tragedy",
            "zh": "悲剧"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shows again how "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "important",
            "ref": "v-important"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " safety rules are, and why they must be followed carefully."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
